<div class="page">
    <h1>MS132-T (Transformer protection)</h1>
    <p>Circuit breakers for transformer protection are protection electrical protection devices specially designed to protect control transformers on the primary side. They allow fuse-less protection against overload and short-circuit, saving space and ensuring a quick reaction under short-circuit condition by switching off the transformer within milliseconds. The device allows manual connection and disconnection of the transformer from the mains.</p>

    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Setting range</th>
                <th>Rated operational current, Ie</th>
                <th>Rated operational voltage, Ue</th>
                <th>Short-circuit breaking capacity, Icu</th>
                <th>Rated instantaneous current, Iinst</th>
                <th>Part Number</th>
                <th>Product Hierarchy 18800001</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for item in ms132t_data %}
            <tr>
                <td><span data-field="ms132t_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].setting_range">{{ ms132t_data[loop.index0].setting_range }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="ms132t_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].rated_current">{{ ms132t_data[loop.index0].rated_current }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="ms132t_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].rated_voltage">{{ ms132t_data[loop.index0].rated_voltage }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="ms132t_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].breaking_capacity">{{ ms132t_data[loop.index0].breaking_capacity }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="ms132t_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].instantaneous_current">{{ ms132t_data[loop.index0].instantaneous_current }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="ms132t_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].part_number">{{ ms132t_data[loop.index0].part_number }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="ms132t_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].product_hierarchy">{{ ms132t_data[loop.index0].product_hierarchy }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>MS132-T is a 40 mm width compact and powerful circuit breaker for transformer protection up to 6.6 kV (400 V) / 25 A. This type also has a clear and reliable indication of fault in a separate window in the event of short-circuit tripping. Further features are the built-in disconnect function, adjustable instantaneous current, and a very high breaking capacity. The handle is also designed for easy operation and adjustment of the instantaneous current settings. Furthermore it is possible to use this MS132-T manual motor starter accessories like auxiliary contacts, signaling contacts, undervoltage relays, shunt trips and feed-in blocks. Moreover ABB offers MS132-T in different frame sizes.</p>
</div>

